{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "86dca17e-d83f-8adf-81a4-0de7636c4062",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:14:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:11:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin, honey, good afternoon. I hope I'm calling the right place. It's about the road being icy. Ocean Avenue, out by me, is a sheet of ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:11:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, you're in the right place. Whereabouts on Ocean Avenue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:11:41-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "387 Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. Now let me tell you, I'm only standing out here because a neighbor asked me to keep an eye on a package for a few days. So I came out to the porch to look, and dear, I nearly went right down on my backside. It's glass out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:12:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. So 387 Ocean Avenue, icy road. Let me write that down. Is it the whole stretch or just a spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's the whole block as far as I can see. The plow came through early, I guess, and left it packed down, and then it thawed a little and froze up again. Nobody's put any sand on it or salt or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:12:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Packed ice, no sand or salt down yet. Any cars having trouble, or is it mostly just walking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:12:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. A little car went sliding sideways by the corner about ten minutes ago. I'm not saying it's anybody's fault, honey, but it's been like this since this morning and it's already lunchtime. It's not like it's a surprise, it's December."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:13:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll put it in as a request for sanding at that location. Ocean Avenue is a busy road, so it should get looked at fairly high up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:13:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when's it going to get done? Is somebody coming today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:13:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd expect this afternoon. The sanding trucks run a route, and I'll flag your spot so they hit it. If they're already out on that side, it could be within a couple of hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of hours. Okay. Because by the time it gets dark this is going to be a skating rink, and I'd hate to see somebody get hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:13:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you want a call back when it's logged as done? I can take a number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:13:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine. It's 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:14:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-nine-seven, got it. 401-555-0197. Carmela, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carmela Lombardozzi, that's right. Two Ms and a Z in the middle, you'll figure it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:14:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll manage. All right, I've got you down for 387 Ocean Avenue, ice on the roadway, needs sand or salt. I'll send it over to the crew supervisor now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:14:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. I appreciate it. I'm going back in before I fall and break something. Stay warm, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:14:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Carmela. Take care, and watch your step."
    }
  ],
